   "date": "2026-10-28T06:22:20Z",
   "email": "person",
   "message": "Routes table: allow for the network fee's known rounding, so one hour no longer freezes the page (#712)\n\nOn 25 Oct at 18:00 Australia to India paid a 56.92 bps network fee on a 6.4% dollar gap, and the\ncheck between the fee steps and the stored total missed by 3.2 bps against a 3 bps allowance. The run\nstopped every hour after, so the routes page showed 25 Oct numbers for three days. The allowance now\ngrows by the network fee times the gap, the one known source, and nothing more.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
