   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-268: country page, cut the hour by hour price list (#705)\n\n* Country page: cut the hour by hour price list, source prices sit beside their names on phones\n\nSeb, 27 Oct: nobody reads or clicks the list. \"Where this price comes from\" already names\neach source and its price, and the footer links the raw data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n* Inventory baseline: country page loses the price list's Show more button on purpose\n\nSeb asked for the hour by hour price list to go (27 Oct). The button went with it.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01KxKUVHG79PHMWt6bz1zpff\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
