   "email": "person",
   "message": "SEB-301: email Seb when collection is down 2 hours or more, and show missed hours on the scorecard (#704)\n\nThe collector watchdog only filed Linear issues nobody reads. tools/outage_email.py posts one comment per outage on the GitHub\nissue \"Collection down\" with an @mention, so GitHub emails Seb. The scorecard's second line is now the hours collection missed.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_017TKMhU7YLPdTWA8YnphhaN\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>"
